{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2c097ce32538f87d8090f365f0b2eac4bfae20a4a8744878550f9c72eff3ac35", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。奈緒が\nウェイトレスとして働く姿を撮ることになった……）", "zh": "（照片杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。决定拍摄奈绪\n作为女服务员工作的模样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "bb6978ab4a73867542308c98b2784c6b8c0a1e0463f4228e2c14d73617ec9d00", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nありがとうございます！　ほんまに感謝してます！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n谢谢您！真的非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1002_p", "source_sha256": "25a9a7021b52512cc606a4330f70a09389aeb3f06645d45f79f94617c2996b79", "ja": "えっ？　いきなりお礼なんて、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？突然道谢，你这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "db9c5e3f10a9d742f728489a4ac4b25fc9d7af38fc6ed93eebc3bb4917c9085d", "ja": "そんなん決まってるやないですか！　めっちゃかわいい\n衣装、選んでくれてありがとうってことです。", "zh": "那还用说嘛！当然是因为想谢谢你帮我选了这么可爱的服装呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "b18b1f9ec1235e32054232c204e90aab5dbf71d1b8cba02eb90a959abe4e77f4", "ja": "いやー。さっすが、{$P$}さん！\n見る目だけはありますね～！", "zh": "哎呀，不愧是{$P$}先生！至少眼光还是很不错的嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cccc34eb85834b45b29a9bf617edd393ae32fb36342774731b5c23e3b3ffb5ae", "ja": "見る目だけ……。まあ、喜んでもらえたのなら何より。\nよく似合っているよ。", "zh": "眼光……好吧，能让你高兴就好。\n很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "7c206dc5279dbfc5114a4b287aaabd163e714e53f61ccbda1c67f48d5b8035cd", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\nでもでも、もっと私に似合う姿があると思うんです。", "zh": "谢谢您♪\n不过不过，我觉得还有更适合我的模样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1007_p", "source_sha256": "71ee719273851edbe7114fb762f83a4e8df9063c1b6298740b559eaa0c92563d", "ja": "もっと、似合う？", "zh": "更加……适合？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "8d5a71690205c7c78fdaf6d1cf119d9b4a892ec8a5200eba610dedfd45c29c15", "ja": "はい！　それは……\n私が、巨大なお好み焼きをひっくり返す姿です！", "zh": "是的！那是……\n我翻转超大的大阪烧时的样子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1009_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "9c7285e3b0ed81ce8d6bc4c6a8ad9dadb80d3190d1987470671164dbc5d09ed4", "ja": "それとも、たこ焼きのがええかな～？\nパパッとひっくり返すんは、得意なんです！　えへへ。", "zh": "还是章鱼烧更好吧～？\n我最擅长迅速把它翻过来啦！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1011_p", "source_sha256": "70cce1a497ba3149c5d06254eed5e3f3693ef4fa191476b1cab6a6e4919e1601", "ja": "お好み焼きにたこ焼きか……。\n確かに、奈緒の魅力が一番出せそうなアイテムだな。", "zh": "大阪烧和章鱼烧吗……确实，这应该是最能展现奈绪魅力的道具了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "7e1519f2774a4621710f805a16c72747c6023c7709ebb88a41985c7844d149cb", "ja": "ですよね～！　見た目のインパクトもバッチリやし、\n見た人の印象にも残りやすいかなーって。", "zh": "对吧～！外观的冲击力也十足，而且我觉得很容易给看过的人留下印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9287187efab893a3b9a272930c21b14ea715bca6d27ecb57551ab06d9114dae7", "ja": "そこまで考えて……。\nよし！　すぐスタッフさんに相談してみるよ！", "zh": "考虑得这么周到……。\n好！我马上去和工作人员商量一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "92dd8ab33ba992327429688cc8afdd30fc8c37e465de0e3b474f1608cdfacad6", "ja": "お願いします♪　最高のパフォーマンスができるよう\n私は練習しときます。あっ、あとで手伝ってください！", "zh": "拜托了♪为了能呈现最棒的演出，我会先练习的。啊，之后也请帮帮我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1015_p", "source_sha256": "433e2b5384061febb5fee6dff5d86cf27164e79fab60a2e2b0058477c3157139", "ja": "ああ、わか……ん？　手伝う？", "zh": "啊，知道了……嗯？帮忙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "3dfb72a8fa0d7b2077a87620fdb4c388d626cd82aa94d94a93a6d428426f05f1", "ja": "はい。お客さんがおらんと、練習になりませんからね。\nカッコいい腕の角度とか、アドバイスお願いします！", "zh": "好的。没有客人的话，就没法练习嘛。\n帅气的手臂角度之类的，还请给我一些建议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0323_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0323_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "fa4605e23ab446158ffb05ab7f935e71c2f7fa7f2b9e91f2a71616e94ef1c7da", "ja": "報酬は、お手製のお好み焼きとたこ焼きで！\n具材のリクエストがあれば、教えてくださいね♪", "zh": "报酬就是我亲手做的大阪烧和章鱼烧！\n如果对食材有什么要求，请尽管告诉我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
